{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:30 2026-08-05 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:30 2026-08-05 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:30 2026-08-05 HKT</p><p>長沙灣發生交通意外。今日（5日）早上9時19分，一輛私家車沿大埔道往沙田方向行駛，當駛至馬騮山對開近金山路一個行人過路處時，撞倒一名清潔女工。女工頭部受傷倒地，其後由救護車送院救治。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/901d1facd89b9c56d8a8a45a83880d07/2026-08/8_1.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3957dbe0b24c228348487d527f5fd27/2026-08/7_3.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4ba2bbe5a2f2c6b2762d707cee6cac1/2026-08/6_1_0.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70f0daac5fd294d066d112c0b18089e3/2026-08/5_1_2.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92dba623618a68ccc399fbafc5b8e790/2026-08/4_1.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8b37bcf15b143a96c7a27ee4b8ef373/2026-08/3_3.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9acf2f3fc4d8afceb7149e7c700aae54/2026-08/2_6.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f46ef225de62df42715904e1c0db77c/2026-08/1_1_3.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6de6f096f20e97f03be621381e5a835/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-05_at_09_59_45_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89c344ffd0c9935640a65fbba1ddb4a0/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-05_at_09_59_45.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe0711fd57fe9749dc86f8d81a32557c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-05_at_09_59_44_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4306d304b914888e50827830f1cc8ad1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-05_at_09_59_44_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e90f8ed68f12cb211914b77e38ca77b7/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-05_at_09_59_44.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-05T02:40:02.110989+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}